-- Legion/BFA pet tamer teams (zrbfacore, 2026-11-02)
-- 23 tamers with a 'defeat in a pet battle' (type 11) quest objective had no battlepet_npc_team_member rows,
-- so "Let's do battle!" (battle-pet-trainers.patch) could never start a fight with them.
-- Teams (species, level, quality) come from the Rematch addon's in-game captured target data;
-- abilities are each species' own 3 abilities from BattlePetSpeciesXAbility.db2 (tamer pets only have 3).
-- breadsMask 8 = breed 3 (B/B), as used by the existing Legion world quest tamer rows.
-- minquality is 0-based: 3 = rare, 4 = epic, 5 = legendary.

DELETE FROM `battlepet_npc_team_member` WHERE `NpcID` IN (139489,140315,140461,140813,140880,141002,141046,141077,141292,141479,141529,141799,141814,141879,141945,142054,142096,142114,142234,115286,124617,98489,115307);
